# ace-core (OVH): CPU decode against the silicon. 2026-10-01
## passport
CPU AMD EPYC 4344P (Zen 4, AM5), 8 cores / 16 threads, boost to 5.39 GHz (governor schedutil), 1 socket, 1 NUMA node
caches: L1d 32 KiB/core, L2 1 MiB/core, L3 32 MiB shared; RAM 125 GB (DDR5, AM5 = 2 channels; channel count/speed need dmidecode = root)
ISA: AVX2, BMI2, AVX-512 F/DQ/CD/BW/VL/IFMA/VBMI/VBMI2/VNNI/BITALG/VPOPCNTDQ/BF16 (Zen 4: 512-bit ops on 256-bit units)
THP: enabled=madvise, defrag=madvise
