## changes (bytes of the archives unchanged; every run compared with the original)
- compressed streams read in place (no 853 MB copy of the archive): t2t 16 threads 0.959 -> 0.622 s
- literal stream on all threads when the token streams are < 1/2 thread's share (2 threads: lit 1 -> 2)
- buffers >= 64 MiB 2 MiB aligned + MADV_HUGEPAGE (AX_HUGE, default 1): free 0.12 -> 0.004 s, faults per 2 MiB
- parallel prefault of buffers >= 1 GiB when lanes > cores (AX_PREFAULT): t2t 16 threads 0.729 -> 0.608 s
- AVX-512 rANS (AX_RANS_SIMD=512, 16 lanes/vector, vpexpandw renormalisation): t2t entropy 1 thread 1.521 -> 1.502 s,
  16 threads 0.352 -> 0.353 s - no gain on Zen 4; kept off by default
- bounds once per token in the match fast zone: noise (silesia 0.194 -> 0.193 s); not kept (earlier commit)
